@* A figure and the word for it: "17 read". The number is the serif display face, the word
   is body text beside it (or under it, Stacked). A caller lays several out with its own
   flex or grid; the figure itself sets only its inside. *@

<span class="stat @SizeClass @(Stacked ? "stat--stacked" : null)">
    <span class="stat__value @(Quiet ? "stat__value--quiet" : null)">@Value</span>
    <span class="stat__label">@Label</span>
    @ChildContent
</span>
